[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0115","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2456","title":"Adobe Flash Player 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 在处理特定 SWF 文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于程序对用户输入的数据边界检查不充分，攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开特制的 Flash 文件触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.11 之前版本和 11.x 系列 11.1.102.55 之前版本，以及 Adobe AIR 3.1.0.4880 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2456"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-11T16:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:22Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.11 或 11.1.102.55 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris），Android 平台升级至 11.1.102.59 及以上版本；同时升级 Adobe AIR 至 3.1.0.4880 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件或使用 Chrome 内置 Flash 沙箱机制缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00014.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00017.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00019.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48819","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-07.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-28.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1445.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14215","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2456.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2456","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2456","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/dat