ion":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x 至 7.0 及 Thunderbird 5.0 至 7.0 版本中存在内部权限检查漏洞。程序在访问控制过程中未正确检查 NoWaiverWrapper 包装器的使用情况，导致 Web 内容可绕过安全限制获取提升的权限。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意网站诱导用户访问，成功利用后可突破浏览器的同源策略和沙箱机制，在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意代码或窃取敏感信息。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，影响 Firefox 和 Thunderbird 两大产品线。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3655"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-09T11:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:42Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 8.0 及以上版本，或升级 Mozilla Thunderbird 至 8.0 及以上版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，可配置内容安全策略（CSP）限制脚本执行，并禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00020.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-52.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=672182","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14202","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3655.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3655","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3655","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3655.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3655","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3655","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3655.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3655","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8