-3654","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3654","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2011/CVE-2011-3654.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-3654.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3654"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0233.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0233.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0232","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3653","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird WebGL 跨源图像信息泄露漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 8.0 之前版本及 Thunderbird 8.0 之前版本在 Mac OS X 系统上与 Intel 集成 GPU 的驱动程序存在交互缺陷，远程攻击者可通过 WebGL 纹理构造特制向量，利用 GPU 内存行为绕过同源策略，窃取跨域图像数据，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击无需认证，复杂度低，仅需诱使用户访问恶意网页即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3653"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-09T11:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:41Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 8.0 及以上版本，或升级 Thunderbird 至 8.0 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 WebGL 功能（在 about:config 中将 webgl.disabled 设为 true）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00020.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-51.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=684882","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13347","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3653","https://github.c